          {
            "identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
            "location_header": "EXT. DUCHESS'S HOUSE - DAY",
            "visual_description": "A chaotic Victorian cottage exterior nestled at the edge of a dark wood. The front door is large, imposing, and framed by heavy timber. Sunlight dapples the forest floor, contrasting with the solid, somewhat foreboding architecture of the house. Earthy browns, forest greens, and stone greys."
          },
          {
            "identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
            "location_header": "INT. DUCHESS'S KITCHEN - DAY",
            "visual_description": "A chaotic Victorian kitchen filled with haze and pungent smoke. A large open fireplace with a bubbling cauldron dominates the wall, casting a flickering orange glow. A three-legged stool sits in the center of the soot-stained room. The atmosphere is stifling, cluttered, and tense."
          },
          {
            "identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
            "location_header": "EXT. THE WOOD - DAY",
            "visual_description": "A winding path through a dense English forest. Ancient trees with gnarled branches create a high canopy, allowing shafts of afternoon sunlight to filter through. Lush ferns and moss cover the ground. The atmosphere is surreal but calmer than the house, with rich greens and soft shadows."
          }
        ]
      },
      "background_key": null
    },
