            "visual_description": "A chaotic Victorian tea party set beneath a large ancient tree in a dappled forest clearing. A long table draped in white cloth stretches out, piled high with mismatched china, teapots, and half-eaten food. Sunlight filters through leaves, creating a whimsical but slightly unkempt atmosphere. Warm greens, creams, and porcelain whites."
